# WP-FAR-13 (proof by WP-PROOF-1126): the far shadow cascade (UE r.Shadow.FarShadow*) - one more level past the
# cascades' Shadows.Distance out to Shadows.FarDistance (Scalability.json: Low 0 = none, Medium 50000, High the
# default 100000), the HLOD/far meshes its casters, sampled where every cascade has run out. Control: Shadows Low
# (FarDistance 0) shows where the cascades end.
Когда run Quality "Quality: Shadows High"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,4000,-60000
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.12,1
Когда advance 2
Тогда far_cascade WP-FAR-13: terrain 150-600 m in front shows sun shadows from the HLOD hills and blocks, continuous with the near cascades' shadows, no shadow cut-off line; log: no "[Shadows] far cascade of shadow slot ... is not cached - redrawn every frame"
Когда run Quality "Quality: Shadows Low"
Когда advance 2
Тогда far_cascade_low control: the same view with FarDistance 0 - shadows end at the cascades' distance in a visible line, the terrain beyond unshadowed (the difference to far_cascade is the far cascade)
Когда run Quality "Quality: Shadows High"
Когда run Action "Stop"
